// The dates are copied rather than transformed, so a test asserts only what the
// query did with them. A trade's product is mapped from every version the feed
// carries, leaving the milestoned property to select one by its date.

###Mapping
Mapping demo::m2m::dates::TradeMapping
(
  *demo::m2m::dates::Trade: Pure
  {
    ~src demo::m2m::dates::source::S_Trade
    id: $src.id,
    tradeDate: $src.tradeDate,
    executedAt: $src.executedAt,
    quantity: $src.quantity,
    product: $src.productAllVersions
  }

  *demo::m2m::dates::Product: Pure
  {
    ~src demo::m2m::dates::source::S_Product
    id: $src.id,
    name: $src.name
  }
)
